<report type:"WARNING">
  description : "AIOS-18-012650 - Apple iOS/iPadOS 18 must implement the management setting: approved Apple Watches must be managed by an MDM."
  info        : "Authorizing official (AO) approval is required before an Apple Watch (DOD-owned or personally owned) can be paired with a DOD-owned iPhone to ensure the AO has evaluated the risk in having sensitive DOD data transferred to and stored on an Apple Watch in their operational environment.

SFRID: FMT_SMF.1.1 #47

NOTE: Nessus has not performed this check. Please review the benchmark to ensure target compliance."
  solution    : "If the AO has not approved the use of Apple Watch with DOD-owned iPhones, this requirement is not applicable.

If the AO has approved the use of Apple Watch with DOD-owned iPhones, enroll the Apple Watch in MDM management.

Note: The iPhone paired to the Apple Watch must be supervised for the MDM to manage the Apple Watch."
  reference   : "800-171|3.4.2,800-171r3|03.04.02a.,800-53|CM-6b.,800-53r5|CM-6b.,CAT|II,CCI|CCI-000366,CN-L3|8.1.10.6(d),CSF|PR.IP-1,CSF2.0|DE.CM-09,CSF2.0|PR.PS-01,DISA_Benchmark|Apple_iOS-iPadOS_18_STIG,GDPR|32.1.b,HIPAA|164.306(a)(1),ISO-27001-2022|A.8.9,ITSG-33|CM-6b.,NESA|T3.2.1,Rule-ID|SV-268049r1031229_rule,STIG-ID|AIOS-18-012650,SWIFT-CSCv1|2.3,Vuln-ID|V-268049"
