<report type:"WARNING">
  description : "AIOS-18-018100 - Apple iOS/iPadOS 18 must implement the management setting: disable Camera."
  info        : "Authorizing Official (AO) approval is required before the Apple device camera can be enabled for a specific user or group of users, based on a risk assessment of the operational environment. Camera use may lead to the exposure of sensitive DOD information in some operational environments.

